    "aa_frostmite_v1_east": {
      "at": "2026-09-12T21:51:12.941Z",
      "decision": "redraw",
      "note": "The\n  Frostmite is interesting and I like most of its body and alien\n  shape, but the mouth turning red suggests meat and oxygenated\n  iron based blood. It should keep the white and blue motif and\n  perhaps even tinge towards yellowish going inward. I like the\n  crystalline sharpness of its body plan. Also very nervous about needing thick black outlines and less detail to ensure we don't lose too much at various zooms. Needs \"mud/blur check\" for how it looks when zoomed out. ",
      "prefill": "keep"
    },
